<title>ITALY: Italy's total reserves 113.536 trln lire in July.</title>
<headline>Italy's total reserves 113.536 trln lire in July.</headline>
<dateline>ROME 1996-08-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Italy's total reserves stood at 113.536 trillion lire at end-July, the Italian Exchange Office said in a statement.</p>
<p>The office gave the following data in trillions of lire:</p>
<p>				    July 96	June 96     July 95</p>
<p>    Total reserves	    113.536	112.742     101.915</p>
<p>    Total assets		115.345	114.579     103.977</p>
<p>     (of which in gold)	39.479	 39.479	44.062</p>
<p>    Liabilities		   1.809	  1.837	 2.062</p>
<p>    (of which short-term)	.245	   .282	   327</p>
</text>
